  "_readme": [
    "The Bangla (বঙ্গাব্দ) calendar as used officially in Bangladesh after the 2019 reform",
    "(বাংলা একাডেমি / শামসুজ্জামান খান কমিটি).",
    "Rules: Boishakh – Ashwin (months 1-6) are 31 days, Kartik – Chaitra are 30 days,",
    "Falgun is 29 days and becomes 30 days whenever the Gregorian year in which it falls is a leap year.",
    "Pahela Baishakh (1 Boishakh) is always 14 April and 1 Poush is always 16 December.",
    "Bangla year = Gregorian year - 593 (for dates on/after 14 April) and -594 before 14 April."
